  {
   "id": "eternights-203367@major-2023-02-09",
   "gameId": "eternights-203367",
   "displayName": "Eternights Spring Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-02-09T16:38:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're delighted to share our brand new Spring Update video with you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since our June 2022 reveal, we've made a plethora of updates to Eternights. To name just a few, one of the the most important aspects we focused on was enhancing the overall gameplay flow and immersion, so players can truly lose themselves in the characters and story of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Outside of that, we have really exciting news about the Japanese voice actors! In the near future, we will announce the Japanese voice actors that have agreed to lend their unique energy and talents to the game. We can’t say much, other than they are well known figures in the anime industry, who have already lent their voices to other beloved characters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eternights is coming this summer, and we hope that you enjoyed the Spring Update video. The team has worked hard to create a unique and engaging world, and we can't wait for you to dive into the world of Eternights and experience it for yourself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
